# damage (it is not an opponent). In turn 2 Bot2 casts Liliana of the Veil too and activates +1: Bot2 takes 1 (19). Bot2 then
# activates Strip Mine against Bot1's Swamp, an ability that uses the stack but is not a loyalty ability: no more damage.

